31.docs:
Copy all elements from the slice and append to the `ArrayVec`.

```
use arrayvec::ArrayVec;

let mut vec: ArrayVec<usize, 10> = ArrayVec::new();
vec.push(1);
vec.try_extend_from_slice(&[2, 3]).unwrap();
